            <ArticleTitle>Managing anxiety and pain during dental treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>37-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Behavioral techniques can teach patients how to cope with anxiety and tension while undergoing dental procedures. Practitioners need to know which technique best fits each patient. This report reviews the repertoire of procedures.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
